    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## AI support agent with human approval\nWebhook (or swap in a **Gmail Trigger**) -> PII scrub + guardrails -> **AI Agent** with 3 tools (CRM, Orders sheet, knowledge base via the Python service's `/tools/*`) -> output guardrails -> **Slack Send & Wait** approval -> Gmail -> audit row.\n\nNothing is ever sent without a human click. Legal emails skip the AI. Blocked drafts never reach the approve button. AI or Gmail failures alert Slack.\n\nCredentials: OpenAI, Slack, Gmail, Google Sheets. Env: AGENT_API_URL, SLACK_APPROVAL_CHANNEL, GOOGLE_SHEETS_ID.",
        "height": 280,
        "width": 620
      },
